{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50267","headline":"秋日过龙兴观墨池 · 李翔","name":"秋日过龙兴观墨池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独登仙馆欲从谁？闻者（有）王君旧墨池。\n苔藓已侵行履迹，洼坳犹是古来规。\n竹梢声认（识）挥毫日，殿角阴疑洗砚时。\n{口叹}（叹）倚坛边红叶树，霜钟欲尽下山迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}